      {
        title: "Overview ΓÇö Why This Module is Critical",
        content: `<h2>Abuse, Neglect & Exploitation</h2>
<p>As a home health care worker, you are a <strong>mandatory reporter</strong> under California law. This means you are <strong>legally required</strong> to report suspected abuse, neglect, or exploitation ΓÇö failure to report is a criminal offense.</p>
<div style="background:#FBE9E7;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;border-left:4px solid #EF4444;">
